# Used only by `vite build` / `vite preview` (not by `npm run dev`).
# Overrides values from `.env` so a production bundle never points at localhost.
#
# On Vercel (or any host), set the same keys in Project → Environment Variables
# (Production) so the live origins replace these placeholders at build time:
VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-frontend.example.com
VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.example.com/api
